source_raw_tex:
\eqalign{(\mu+\lambda)G
&=\mu G+\sup\{
u F-\mu F:F\in\Tau,\,F\subseteq G\}\cr
&=\sup\{
u F+\mu(G\setminus F):F\in\Tau,\,F\subseteq G\}\cr
&\le\sup\{
u F+
u(G\setminus F):F\in\Tau,\,F\subseteq G\}
=
u G,\cr}

